Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.38,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Dez pras seis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:04.53,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Este dia nunca mais acaba,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:06.27,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Estou de rastos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:07.99,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vou preparar o jantar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:10.25,Vlog,,0,0,0,,A partir das seis da tarde
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.25,0:00:11.18,Vlog,,0,0,0,,isso é loucura, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.48,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Espera, filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.25,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vou ser honesta,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:14.17,Vlog,,0,0,0,,eu ia fazer jantar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.17,0:00:15.57,Vlog,,0,0,0,,mas já não vou, porque, não dá.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.57,0:00:16.73,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vou fazer uns ovos e vou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.73,0:00:17.65,Vlog,,0,0,0,,servir a sopa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:19.13,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Eu descobri a melhor sopa de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:20.26,Vlog,,0,0,0,,sempre no Continente,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:21.30,Vlog,,0,0,0,,a receita do chef,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:22.34,Vlog,,0,0,0,,sopa de abóbora,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:24.32,Vlog,,0,0,0,,camarão e coentros, é maravilhosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:24.94,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Amamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:26.24,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá tomar banhoca,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:31.05,Vlog,,0,0,0,,É sopa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:31.75,Vlog,,0,0,0,,não é doce,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:33.75,Vlog,,0,0,0,,não pode ser sempre doce, filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:41.07,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Posso ficar com mais sopa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:41.65,Vlog,,0,0,0,,Podes, podes.
